{"created":"2023-08-01T07:59:36.548689+00:00","modified":"2024-07-11T16:19:59.153203+00:00","id":8176941,"conceptrecid":"4417809","doi":"10.5281/zenodo.8176941","conceptdoi":"10.5281/zenodo.4417809","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8176941","metadata":{"title":"The 30 m annual land cover datasets and its dynamics in China from 1985 to 2022","doi":"10.5281/zenodo.8176941","publication_date":"2023-08-01","description":"<p>Using 335,709 Landsat images on the Google Earth Engine, we built the&nbsp;first Landsat-derived annual land cover product of China (CLCD) from 1985 to 2019. We collected the training samples by combining stable samples extracted from China&#39;s Land-Use/Cover Datasets (CLUD), and visually-interpreted samples from satellite time-series data, Google Earth and Google Map. Several temporal metrics were constructed via all available Landsat data and fed to the random forest classifier to obtain classification results. A post-processing method incorporating spatial-temporal filtering and logical reasoning was further proposed to improve the spatial-temporal consistency of CLCD.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&quot;*_albert.tif&quot;&nbsp;are projected files via a proj4 string &quot;+proj=aea +lat_1=25 +lat_2=47 +lat_0=0 +lon_0=105 +x_0=0 +y_0=0 +datum=WGS84 +units=m +no_defs&quot;.</p>\n\n<p>CLCD in 2022 is now available.</p>\n\n<p>1. Given that the&nbsp;USGS no longer maintains the Landsat Collection 1 data, we are now using&nbsp;the <a href=\"https://www.usgs.gov/landsat-missions/landsat-collection-2\">Collection 2</a> SR data to update the CLCD.</p>\n\n<p>2. All files in this version have been exported as Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF&nbsp;for more efficient processing on the cloud. Please check <a href=\"https://www.cogeo.org/\">here</a> for more details.</p>\n\n<p>3. Internal overviews and color tables are built into each file to&nbsp;speed up software loading and rendering.</p>","access_right":"open","keywords":["Land cover; Land cover dynamics; Landsat; Google Earth Engine;China"],"version":"1.0.2","language":"eng","resource_type":{"title":"Dataset","type":"dataset"},"journal":{"issue":"1","pages":"3907–3925","title":"Earth System Science Data","volume":"13"},"license":{"id":"cc-by-4.0"},"relations":{"version":[{"index":3,"is_last":false,"parent":{"pid_type":"recid","pid_value":"4417809"}}]}},"title":"The 30 m annual land cover datasets and its dynamics in China from 1985 to 2022","links":{"self":"https://zenodo.org/api/records/8176941","self_html":"https://zenodo.org/records/8176941","preview_html":"https://zenodo.org/records/8176941?preview=1","doi":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8176941","self_doi":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8176941","self_doi_html":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8176941","reserve_doi":"https://zenodo.org/api/records/8176941/draft/pids/doi","parent":"https://zenodo.org/api/records/4417809","parent_html":"https://zenodo.org/records/4417809","parent_doi":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4417809","parent_doi_html":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.4417809","self_iiif_manifest":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941/manifest","self_iiif_sequence":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941/sequence/default","files":"https://zenodo.org/api/records/8176941/files","media_files":"https://zenodo.org/api/records/8176941/media-files","thumbnails":{"10":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941:CLCD_v01_1990_albert.tif/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg","50":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941:CLCD_v01_1990_albert.tif/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg","100":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941:CLCD_v01_1990_albert.tif/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg","250":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941:CLCD_v01_1990_albert.tif/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg","750":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941:CLCD_v01_1990_albert.tif/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg","1200":"https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8176941:CLCD_v01_1990_albert.tif/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"},"latest":"https://zenodo.org/api/rec